sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Actor as Citizen / Recycler
    participant UI as Daily Check-in Screen
    participant Ctrl as UserGamificationController
    participant ChkSvc as CheckinService
    participant CfgSvc as GamificationConfigService
    participant PtsSvc as PointsService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Note over Actor,DB: U-13: Diem danh hang ngay ICT UTC+7, tinh chuoi Streak va tran diem phi giao dich (BR-GAM-02, BR-GAM-09)

    Actor->>UI: Mo trang /check-in hoac /gamification
    UI->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/gamification/check-in/status
    Ctrl->>ChkSvc: GetStatusAsync(userId)
    ChkSvc->>CfgSvc: GetSettingsAsync()
    CfgSvc->>DB: EnsureDefaults & Doc gamification_config (base, inc, cap)
    ChkSvc->>DB: Query daily_checkin_logs 7 ngay gan nhat + Sum point_transactions trong ngay ICT
    ChkSvc->>PtsSvc: GetWalletAsync(userId)
    Ctrl-->>UI: 200 OK CheckinStatusDto (streak, todayRewardPreview, dailyCapRemaining, calendar)

    Actor->>UI: Nhan nut Diem danh hom nay
    UI->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/gamification/check-in
    Ctrl->>ChkSvc: CheckInAsync(userId)
    ChkSvc->>DB: BeginTransaction & Kiem tra last.CheckinDate == today (UTC+7)
    alt Da diem danh hom nay
        ChkSvc-->>Ctrl: BusinessRuleException (BR-GAM-09, MSG-GEN-01)
        Ctrl-->>UI: 400 Bad Request
    else Chua diem danh hom nay
        ChkSvc->>ChkSvc: Tinh streakCount = (hom qua da check-in ? streak + 1 : 1)
        ChkSvc->>DB: CapRemainingAsync = Max(0, DailyCap - Sum(DailyCheckin hom nay))
        alt DailyCapRemaining <= 0
            ChkSvc-->>Ctrl: BusinessRuleException (BR-GAM-02, MSG-GAM-05)
            Ctrl-->>UI: 400 Bad Request
        else Con han muc tran ngay
            ChkSvc->>DB: INSERT daily_checkin_logs (UX ux_daily_checkin_user_date chong bam dup)
            ChkSvc->>PtsSvc: CreditAsync(award = Min(reward, remaining), DailyCheckin, CHECKIN:userId:date)
            PtsSvc->>DB: INSERT point_transactions + UPDATE user_point_wallets
            ChkSvc->>DB: Commit Transaction
            Ctrl-->>UI: 200 OK MSG-GAM-08 (pointsAwarded, streakCount, limitedByDailyCap, walletBalance)
        end
    end
